{
  "duration": 58.44,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "Take the comma out of your price, and it looks cheaper.",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 2.92,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "$1,499 and $1499 are the same price.",
      "start": 3.2,
      "end": 9.12,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Your brain doesn't think so.",
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 11.44,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Here's the trick.",
      "start": 11.897,
      "end": 12.72,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "You read prices in your head, even when you don't say them.",
      "start": 13.04,
      "end": 16.64,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "One thousand, four hundred and ninety nine.",
      "start": 16.782,
      "end": 19.2,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Fourteen ninety nine.",
      "start": 19.32,
      "end": 20.72,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "In 2012, researchers Keith Coulter, Pilsik Choi and Kent Monroe found that the longer a price sounds, the bigger it feels.",
      "start": 20.8,
      "end": 29.44,
      "matched": "21/21"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "A comma makes it sound longer.",
      "start": 29.52,
      "end": 31.493,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "So do cents.",
      "start": 31.547,
      "end": 32.64,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "But it gets weirder.",
      "start": 32.84,
      "end": 34.4,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Cornell researchers gave diners the same menu three ways.",
      "start": 34.48,
      "end": 38.16,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "Dollar signs, words, or just the numbers.",
      "start": 38.24,
      "end": 41.28,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "With just the numbers, people spent about eight percent more.",
      "start": 41.486,
      "end": 45.04,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "The dollar sign reminds you you're paying.",
      "start": 45.12,
      "end": 47.44,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, write your price short.",
      "start": 47.646,
      "end": 50.72,
      "matched": "9/9"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "No comma, no cents, no dollar sign if you can get away with it.",
      "start": 50.84,
      "end": 54.64,
      "matched": "14/14"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Send this to the friend whose price list looks like a tax form.",
      "start": 54.846,
      "end": 57.84,
      "matched": "13/13"
    }
  ],
